<title>JAPAN: Small-lot buying lifts Fuji Photo in early morning.</title>
<headline>Small-lot buying lifts Fuji Photo in early morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Small-lot buying lifted Fuji Photo Film Co Ltd's share price in early Monday morning trade, as investors resumed buying of global issues after rounds of selling on Friday, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0028 GMT, the shares were 10 yen higher at 3,820 yen, the 17th most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange in a volume of 583,000.</p>
</text>
